│                          │ trainable parameters. Removing the independent RZ rotations avoids redundant phase        │
│                          │ freedom, should preserve the already perfect accuracy on this apparently simple task, and │
│                          │ strongly improves parameter economy, convergence, and resistance to overfitting.          │
