│ patch_description        │ This ansatz retains the proven collective RY structure and first parallel CZ matching,    │
│                          │ then replaces the second fixed CZ layer with a single shared CRZ parameter. The added     │
│                          │ shared entangling angle increases expressivity while introducing only one trainable mode  │
│                          │ per repeated block. Parameter sharing across all four CRZ gates preserves symmetry,       │
│                          │ limits overfitting, and keeps optimization substantially more economical than             │
│                          │ independently parameterized entanglers.                                                   │
