│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ single_axis_collective_layer                                                              │
│ patch_description        │ Remove the redundant shared RX layer while retaining the collective RY rotations and      │
│                          │ connected entangling topology. Prior results show that collective RY dynamics already     │
│                          │ achieve perfect accuracy, while the extra noncommuting RX gates increase depth and        │
│                          │ repeatedly apply the same parameter, potentially creating a more oscillatory optimization │
│                          │ landscape. This edit preserves the eight effective parameters and expressive ring         │
│                          │ correlations but should reduce gate count from 144 to 96 and depth from 24 to roughly 18, │
│                          │ with a simpler objective that may converge faster.                                        │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
